## AI (`Application/AI/`)

Roadmaps: `docs/ai-memory.md`, `docs/email-read-implementation-plan.md`. Detail: `AI/Agents/README.md`, `AI/Tools/README.md`.

| Folder | Role |
|--------|------|
| **AI/** root | `ChatOrchestrator` — turn routing |
| **Agents/** | LLM only; no DB |
| **Tools/** | Slice repos + Shared services; no LLM; no `IDbContextFactory` |
| **Memory/** | DB enrich; Foundry summarize on refresh |
| **Workflows/** | Multi-step, not single agent turn |

**Boundaries:** Agents = LLM · Tools = repos · Features handlers save + call orchestrator · Foundry factory in Infrastructure.

**Naming:** `{Domain}TriageAgent`, `{Domain}TriageTools`, `{Role}Agent`, `RunAsync` / `CreateTools` / `RunChatAgentAsync`.
